########################################

!node About

 CAB.OVL is a module for Cristal Atari Brownser 'CAB' for HTTP protocole
 under TCP/IP stack (!STinG), STiK, IConnect or MintNet with GlueStik.
 
 Support server Authentification and cookie under CAB < 2.7 to.


 For STiK users, STIK.ACC contains essential TCP/IP routines apart
 from the in-built dialer, so it must stay present. 

!begin_center

** This is a BETA VERSION for beta testers only. **

!end_center

########################################

!node Installation

Save your old cab.ovl and put this one in your CAB/MODULES/ folder
with is CAB_OVL.RSC file.


########################################

!node Configuration

!ifdest [html]
Please click on (!xlink [SETUP][http://cab.ovl]) for set CABOVL configuration.
!else
Please ask for http://cab.ovl in CAB for set CABOVL configuration.
!endif

