!node Bugs

!begin_itemize

!item CAB 2.5X can not send request for URL > 81 characters, some formulars
can not be sended propely with this version.


!item In some servers with cookies, an error return 'bad request',
so you can refuse cookie by configuring until this
problem is persistant.

!item Many errors come from NetWork, servers or CAB versions so before
email me ( see Author ), (!B) BE SURE THAT MALFUNCTION IS CAB.OVL FAULT (!b) by testing with
other plateforms and other CAB.OVL. Send my Logfile, CAB.APP and CAB.OVL
versions.

!end_itemize

